    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even want to talk to a therapist about it anymore. it feels like i'm just circular. i just think... if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to worry about me. like, the weight would just be gone for them. wouldn't it be better if the problem was just... gone? so they could finally be happy without me holding them back?",
